{"2597640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harmony of Aetheria", "steam_appid": 2597640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Aetheria</strong>, a vibrant fantasy world where villagers complain about sheep, wizards throw tantrums, and some grandmas will beat you with sticks if you mess with their knitting circle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and Talk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t another silent hero story. You are Fayme, a loudmouth whose tongue is deadlier than any blade. <strong>Fight and talk at the same time</strong> using swords, spells, and sharp insults. Trash-talk a wizard mid-fireball and walk away victorious - or push them so far they turn you into ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So fight with fists, fight with fire, or fight with words. Either way, someone’s leaving embarrassed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Banter:</strong> Talk during combat to provoke, manipulate, or outsmart enemies in real time. Your words can change how they behave and how the fight ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Combat:</strong> Punches, kicks, weapons, spells, dodges, parries, and ridiculous finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies With Feelings:</strong> Rage, fear, pride, vanity - exploit their emotions to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Magic:</strong> Master powerful spells of fire, air, water, and earth. They look spectacular (and occasionally backfire).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Fantasy World:</strong> Explore a quirky land full of eccentric characters and sarcastic quests. Speak or fight - or do both at once.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Aetheria</strong>, a vibrant fantasy world where villagers complain about sheep, wizards throw tantrums, and some grandmas will beat you with sticks if you mess with their knitting circle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and Talk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t another silent hero story. You are Fayme, a loudmouth whose tongue is deadlier than any blade. <strong>Fight and talk at the same time</strong> using swords, spells, and sharp insults. Trash-talk a wizard mid-fireball and walk away victorious - or push them so far they turn you into ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So fight with fists, fight with fire, or fight with words. Either way, someone’s leaving embarrassed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Banter:</strong> Talk during combat to provoke, manipulate, or outsmart enemies in real time. Your words can change how they behave and how the fight ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Combat:</strong> Punches, kicks, weapons, spells, dodges, parries, and ridiculous finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies With Feelings:</strong> Rage, fear, pride, vanity - exploit their emotions to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Magic:</strong> Master powerful spells of fire, air, water, and earth. They look spectacular (and occasionally backfire).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Fantasy World:</strong> Explore a quirky land full of eccentric characters and sarcastic quests. Speak or fight - or do both at once.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Speak and fight at the same time - your words are weapons, letting you enrage, manipulate, or break enemies during combat. What you say shapes the fight and changes the outcome.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/259764